cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: 'Symphony Open "MSP-Symphony"'
authors:
  - name: Swedish Agency for Marine and Water Management
version: 1.25.0
date-released: '2026-06-05'
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/havochvatten/MSP-Symphony
abstract: >-
  Symphony is a method developed by the Swedish Agency for Marine and Water
  Management to quantitatively weigh ecosystems and environmental pressures,
  so that the cumulative environmental impact of different marine spatial
  planning options can be objectively compared. This repository contains a
  web application for building and evaluating Symphony scenarios.
keywords:
  - marine spatial planning
  - cumulative impact assessment
  - ecosystem-based management
  - environmental pressures
